{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/FormatReplacement.html#Lean.Elab.DeprecatedSyntax.formatReplacement\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">DeprecatedSyntax</span>.<span class=\"name\">formatReplacement</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cat</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">stx </span><span class=\"fn\">newStx</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">range</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Syntax.html#Lean.Syntax.Range\">Syntax.Range</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the text replacing the source of `stx`, which has category `cat` and source range `range`,\nby `newStx`. See the module docstring for how the text is made to fit into the surrounding source.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/FormatReplacement.html#Lean.Elab.DeprecatedSyntax.formatReplacement","kind":"def","line":107,"name":"Lean.Elab.DeprecatedSyntax.formatReplacement","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/DeprecatedSyntax/FormatReplacement.lean#L107-L128"}}],"imports":["Lean.CoreM","Lean.Meta.TryThis","Lean.PrettyPrinter.Formatter","Lean.PrettyPrinter.Parenthesizer"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Elab.DeprecatedSyntax.FormatReplacement"}